@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam object {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}

title A non-Boolean Heyting algebra: the chain `⊥ < M < ⊤` where `¬¬M ≠ M`

' ── The 3-element chain Heyting algebra (the real `Chain3` model) ─────────
' Hasse diagram: nodes stacked bottom-to-top, covers drawn as plain `--`
' edges (no arrowheads). Order grows upward: ⊥ ≤ M ≤ ⊤.
object "⊤  (top)" as Top #DCFCE7
object "M  (middle)" as Mid #FEF3C7
object "⊥  (bottom)" as Bot #DCFCE7

' covering relations of the chain (drawn bottom-to-top)
Bot -- Mid
Mid -- Top

note right of Mid
  **M is the non-regular boundary element**
  (the `Sat3::DontKnow` avatar)
  ----
  `¬M = (M → ⊥) = ⊥`   (since `M ≰ ⊥`)
  `¬¬M = ¬⊥ = ⊤ ≠ M`   (double negation overshoots)
  excluded middle fails:
  `M ∨ ¬M = M ∨ ⊥ = M ≠ ⊤`
end note

note left of Top
  `⊥` and `⊤` are **regular**
  (`¬¬⊥ = ⊥`, `¬¬⊤ = ⊤`)
  — classical reasoning is sound here.
end note

legend right
|= Color |= Meaning |
|<#DCFCE7> | regular element (`¬¬a = a`): recovered-classical |
|<#FEF3C7> | non-regular boundary element (Heyting-only) |
endlegend
@enduml
